ies,\ttrading,\tresulting\tprimarily\tfrom\tdeclines\tin\tmarket\tperformance of\tthe\tunderlying\tinvestment\tfunds\tsupporting\tthe\tJapanese\tvariable\tannuity\tproduct.\tTotal\tnet\tinvestment\tincome,\texcluding\tequity securities,\ttrading,\tincreased\tprimarily\tdue\tto\timproved\tperformance\tof\tlimited\tpartnerships\tand\tother\talternative\tinvestments\tprimarily within\treal\testate\tand\tprivate\tequity\tfunds,\tpartially\toffset\tby\tlower\tincome\ton\tfixed\tmaturities\tresulting\tfrom\ta\tdecline\tin\taverage\tshort- term\tinterest\trates\tand\tlower\treinvestment\trates.\n\n# Net\tRealized\tCapital\tGains\t(Losses)\n\n|  | 2011 | 2010 | 2009 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Gross\\tgains\\ton\\tsales | $693 | $836 | $1,056 |\n| Gross\\tlosses\\ton\\tsales | (384) | (522) | (1,397) |\n| Net\\tOTTI\\tlosses\\trecognized\\tin\\tearnings | (174) | (434) | (1,508) |\n| Valuation\\tallowances\\ton\\tmortgage\\tloans | 24 | (154) | (403) |\n| Japanese\\tfixed\\tannuity\\tcontract\\thedges,\\tnet\\t[1] | 3 | 27 | 47 |\n| Periodic\\tnet\\tcoupon\\tsettlements\\ton\\tcredit\\tderivatives/Japan | (10) | (17) | (49) |\n| Results\\tof\\tvariable\\tannuity\\thedge\\tprogram |  |  |  |\n| U.S.\\tGMWB\\tderivatives,\\tnet | (397) | 89 | 1,464 |\n| U.S.\\tmacro\\thedge\\tprogram | (216) | (445) | (733) |\n| Total\\tU.S.\\tprogram | (613) | (356) | 731 |\n| International\\tprogram | 775 | 11 | (112) |\n| Total\\tresults\\tof\\tvariable\\tannuity\\thedge\\tprogram | 162 | (345) | 619 |\n| Other,\\tnet\\t[2] | (459) | (2) | (369) |\n| Net\\trealized\\tcapital\\tgains\\t(losses),\\tbefore-tax | $(145) | $(611) | $(2,004) |\n\n[1] \t Relates\tto\tthe\tJapanese\tfixed\tannuity\tproduct\t(adjustment\tof\tproduct\tliability\tfor\tchanges\tin\tspot\tcurrency\texchange\trates,\trelated derivative\thedging\tinstruments,\texcluding\tnet\tperiod\tcoupon\tsettlements,\tand\tJapan\tFVO\tsecurities).\n\n[2] \t Primarily\tconsists\tof\tgains\tand\tlosses\ton\tnon-qualifying\tderi