ely\tmanaged funds\tas\tcompared\tto\ttheir\trespective\tindices\tof\t$550,\tand\tthe\timpact\tof\tthe Company's\town\tcredit\tstanding\tof\t$154.\tAdditional\tnet\tgains\tof\t$56\tresulted\tfrom lower\timplied\tmarket\tvolatility\tand\ta\tgeneral\tincrease\tin\tlong-term\tinterest\trates, partially\toffset\tby\trising\tequity\tmarkets.\tThe\tnet\tloss\ton\tthe\tU.S.\tmacro\thedge program\twas\tprimarily\tthe\tresult\tof\ta\thigher\tequity\tmarket\tvaluation. Other,\tnet •\t\t\t\t\tOther,\tnet\tloss\tfor\tthe\tyear\tended\tDecember\t31,\t2011,\twas\tprimarily\tdue\tto\tlosses\tof ($148)\ton\tcredit\tderivatives\tand\tfair\tvalue\toption\tsecurities\tdriven\tby\tcredit\tspread widening\tand\tlosses\tof\t($141)\ton\ttransactional\tforeign\tcurrency\tre-valuation associated\twith\tthe\tinternal\treinsurance\tof\tthe\tJapan\tvariable\tannuity\tbusiness,\twhich is\toffset\tin\tAOCI,\tdue\tto\tappreciation\tof\tthe\tJapanese\tyen\tversus\tthe\tU.S.\tdollar. Additionally,\tlosses\tof\t($94)\tfor\tthe\tyear\tended\tDecember\t31,\t2011\tresulted\tfrom equity\tfutures\tand\toptions\tused\tto\thedge\tequity\tmarket\trisk\tin\tthe\tinvestment portfolio\tdue\tto\tan\tincrease\tin\tthe\tequity\tmarket\tduring\tthe\thedged\tperiod.\tAlso included\twere\tlosses\tof\t($69)\ton\tJapan\t3Win\tforeign\tcurrency\tswaps\tprimarily\tdriven by\ta\tdecrease\tin\tlong-term\tU.S.\tinterest\trates.\n\n•\t\t\t\t\tOther,\tnet\tloss\tfor\tthe\tyear\tended\tDecember\t31,\t2010\twas\tprimarily\tdue\tto\ta\tloss\tof ($326)\ton\ttransactional\tforeign\tcurrency\tre-valuation\tdue\tto\tan\tincrease\tin\tvalue\tof the\tJapanese\tyen\tversus\tthe\tU.S.\tdollar\tassociated\twith\tthe\tinternal\treinsurance\tof\tthe Japan\tvariable\tannuity\tbusiness,\twhich\tis\toffset\tin\tAOCI.\tThis\tloss\twas\tpartially offset\tby\tgains\tof\t$217\ton\tcredit\tderivatives\tdriven\tby\tcredit\tspread\ttightening,\tand gains\tof\t$59\ton\tinterest\trate\tderivatives\tused\tto\tmanage\tportfolio\tduration\tdriven\tby\ta