es\t$12.82\tbillion\tof\tprivate\tequity\tinvestments,\t$1.37\tbillion\tof\tinvestments\tin\treal\testate\tentities\tand\t$491\tmillion\tof\tconvertible\tdebentures.\n\n|  | Cash\tInstrument\tAssets\tat\tFair\tValue\tas\tof\tDecember\t2012 | Cash\tInstrument\tAssets\tat\tFair\tValue\tas\tof\tDecember\t2012 | Cash\tInstrument\tAssets\tat\tFair\tValue\tas\tof\tDecember\t2012 | Cash\tInstrument\tAssets\tat\tFair\tValue\tas\tof\tDecember\t2012 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| in\\tmillions | Level\\t1 | Level\\t2 | Level\\t3 | Total |\n| Commercial\\tpaper,\\tcertificates\\tof\\tdeposit,\\ttime\\tdeposits\\tand\\tother\\tmoney\\tmarket\\tinstruments | \\t$\\t\\t\\t\\t2,155 | \\t$\\t\\t\\t\\t3,902 | \\t$\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t— | \\t$\\t\\t\\t\\t6,057 |\n| U.S.\\tgovernment\\tand\\tfederal\\tagency\\tobligations | 42,856 | 50,385 | — | 93,241 |\n| Non-U.S.\\tgovernment\\tand\\tagency\\tobligations | 46,715 | 15,509 | 26 | 62,250 |\n| 1:\\nMortgage\\tand\\tother\\tasset-backed\\tloans\\tand\\tsecurities\\nLoans\\tand\\tsecurities\\tbacked\\tby\\tcommercial\\treal\\testate | — | 6,416 | 3,389 | 9,805 |\n| Loans\\tand\\tsecurities\\tbacked\\tby\\tresidential\\treal\\testate | — | 6,597 | 1,619 | 8,216 |\n| Bank\\tloans\\tand\\tbridge\\tloans | — | 11,172 | 11,235 | 22,407 |\n| Corporate\\tdebt\\tsecurities\\t^2 | 111 | 18,049 | 2,821 | 20,981 |\n| State\\tand\\tmunicipal\\tobligations | — | 1,858 | 619 | 2,477 |\n| Other\\tdebt\\tobligations\\t^2 | — | 1,066 | 1,185 | 2,251 |\n| Equities\\tand\\tconvertible\\tdebentures | 72,875 | 8,724 | 14,855^\\t3 | 96,454 |\n| Commodities | — | 11,696 | — | 11,696 |\n| Total | \\t$164,712 | \\t$135,374 | \\t $35,749 | \\t$335,835 |\n\n|  | Cash\tInstrument\tLiabilities\tat\tFair\tValue\tas\tof\tDecember\t2012 | Cash\tInstrument\tLiabilities\tat\tFair\tValue\tas\tof\tDecember\t2012 | Cash\tInstrument\tLiabilities\tat\tFair\tValue\tas\tof\tDecember\t2012 | Cash\tInstrument\tLiabilities\tat\tFair\tValue\tas\tof\tDecember\t2012 |